  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>A straight line passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and makes a angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo></msup></math> with the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis,</p><p>And it is rotated by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>15</mn><mo>°</mo></msup></math> degree clockwise</p><p>So, the new angle with the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mo>°</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mo>°</mo></msup></math></p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/16264301-8f71-4f14-8167-bfd7dcc56e80.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 189px;\"/></p><p>Hence, the equation of the line will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><msup><mn>15</mn><mo>°</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
    "image": null
